   ]
  ]
 },
 {
  "index": 8,
  "label": "text",
  "content": "We had planned the walk around the tide tables, as everyone must here. The causeway to the island is open for a few hours either side of low water, and an early start means the difference between a dry crossing and a long wait with a flask of tea.",
